  <data name="textBox1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This Program is made to organize your tasks. 
The program can have multiple tabs that hold tasks.
To add new tabs or tasks, you need to enter the Edit mode by click on Edit on the menu. then click on the pen beside the tabs to add or edit tabs or click on "Add Task" to add new tasks.

Tasks have info including name, description, reset time based on days and time, and expiration date. Each task contains components including Todo, counters and timers.

Todo is just a reminder that you can check out when you done it, counter can help to count things down or up, and Timer can be either stop watch or time down timer.

To enter quick edit mode hold Shift Key and mouse click on any component to edit including: The task group box, Todo checkboxes and buttons, Counters and timers.

For more detailed toturial check Readme.MD at
https://github.com/Cookiesliyr/CookiesDoList/blob/master/README.md

</value>
